      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "text" : "Hmmm... He's a swordsman..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "text" : "You know that I am De Thomas Carlos, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "text" : "Knight of Prontera's 3rd Calvary."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "text" : "De Thomas Carlos!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "text" : "You do not have all the items I asked for."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "text" : "Remember, I need ^008800200 empty bottles^000000, your armor, and a ^008800Moth Wing^000000. Come back when you have it all."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "text" : "My name is De Thomas Carlos."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "text" : "Knight of Prontera's 3rd Calvary."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "text" : "I have a certain duty these days."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "text" : "Ehem! Need I say more."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "text" : "Oh, no! You must have been hurt! Are you ok?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "text" : "You must have fought hard to get such serious injuries.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "text" : "Being a swordsman must come with a lot of responsibility and sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "text" : "For these swordsmen and knights, there is a wonderful skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "text" : "For these swordswomen and knights, there is a wonderful skill young lady."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "text" : "I present to you - HP Recovery While Moving!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "text" : "Body moving is a splendid skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "text" : "that allows you to regain strength(HP)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "text" : "while you are moving!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "text" : "It is currently under development"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "text" : "so it may not recover that much,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "text" : "but it will help a little."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "text" : "What do you think? Would you like to learn this skill?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 116,
      "text" : "What a nice skill! I want to learn it!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 116,
      "text" : "No, thank you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "text" : "Very well. I will tell you what you need to learn this skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "text" : "First, your job level must be higher than ^00880035^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "text" : "You will also need ^008800200 empty bottles^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "text" : "Why? Because it is proof that you fought fiercely to have used that many potions."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "text" : "Also, the armor you used in battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "text" : "This is also proof of an experienced fighter."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "text" : "For the armor... your armor is perfect!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "text" : "Bring your armor!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "text" : "Last but not least... bring me one ^008800Moth Wing^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 131,
      "text" : "Eh? You need that, too?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "text" : "Not really.. I don't really NEED it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "text" : "It's just that my niece has gotten a bug hunting as a holiday task during the summer vacation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "text" : "Of course! It would be much easier for me to get it myself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "text" : "but I must work here all the time so I don't exactly have the time to go out and get it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "text" : "[De Thomas]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "text" : "Don't you think it is pitiful that I have to stay in once place everyday, not being able to go outside?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "text" : "Please, find me one...*sniffsniff*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "text" : "If you don't..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
