    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "I'm at a loss of words!?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "[Sushi King Leon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "The best way to eat sushi is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "with your hands."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "That is the basic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "And dip the fish, not the rice,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "in the soy sauce."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "[Sushi King Leon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "That way you get a richer flavor."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Also, always eat the kind that is in season."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Eating in the order of white fish then"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "blue fish will make it taste better!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Mmm! I like sushi~~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "[Leon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Oh, no! I have nothing to offer you!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "I can't say nice and fun things to anyone"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "other than swordsmen!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "See you in a better world!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "[Leon]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Hahahahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Leon Von Frich",
      "text" : "Hahahahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Mmm? Long time no see!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "How are you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You got stronger than before."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Many expect great things from you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You can do it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[?]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "What are you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Eh, still a beginner."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "I'm busy, so go train a little more"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "before coming back."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Oh, nice to meet you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You can be on your way. (smiley~)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Ooh. Young swordsman!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You are ready to learn the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "newest skill, Auto Berserk?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Hoho, I would like to learn it now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "What is that?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Ok. Then..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You have just become a swordsman"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "that can use Auto Berserk."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You can go about "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "and achieve great things!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Good luck!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "....................................oh yeah."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "I forgot to say something."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "There are some things you must keep in mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Once you regain health,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "this skill will subside."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Also, there isn't really a time limit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "but it can still disappear when"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "it is attacked with a skill that can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "nullify provoke."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "If you don't remember these characteristics,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "you may run into some problems on the battlefield"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "when the skill disappears all of a sudden."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Then... bye for real~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Auto Berserk?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "It's a skill crucial on the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "When your health is in red,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "your hidden potential provokes yourself"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 382,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "to help you in battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "It is perfect for those that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "fight on the battlefield like fire!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "With your ability, you can learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "this skill right now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "Then, I shall tell you the necessary materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "[Juan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "You need 35 Powder of Butterfly."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Juan",
      "text" : "The energy from the magnificent"
    },
